ctured error classifications."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Anonymized model latency percentiles and cost estimations."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white","children":"3. Prompt & Input Sanitization"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Payload memos, customer chat inputs, and unstructured agent contexts are routed through client-side sanitization guards. Any potential secret keys (API tokens, private keys) are redacted at source prior to ledger serialization."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white","children":"4. Regulatory Context & Jurisdictional Notice"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"NexusGuard supports customer compliance mappings under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI RMF), and relevant South Asian digital data protection principles. Usage on live financial infrastructure is informational and subject to formal merchant/partner agreements and legal review."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white","children":"5. Data Retention & Cryptographic Erasure"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Users can configure telemetry retention windows (7 days, 30 days, or 90 days). Upon window expiry, transient telemetry records are securely deleted. Signed ledger digests retain mathematical integrity without retaining raw transaction attributes."}]]}]]}]]}]}],null,["$","$L2",null,{"children":["$","$3",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@4"}]}]]}],"isPartial":"$@5","staleTime":"$6","varyParams":null},{"rsc":["$","$1","h",{"children":[null,["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","meta","0",{"charSet":"utf-8"}],["$","meta","1",{"name":"viewport","content":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1"}],["$","meta","2",{"name":"theme-color","content":"#020617"}],["$","meta","3",{"name":"color-scheme","